decision readout for https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B

give it a state, a question and a few options. it runs one
forward pass and returns a probability for each option, read
straight from the logits. nothing is generated or parsed.

https://github.com/TheoLeeCJ/openjev did this with a 4B model.

quick demo:

    $ ./run.sh uv run example.py
